{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00434","headline":"郊庙歌辞 武后明堂乐章 皇帝行 · 武则天","name":"郊庙歌辞 武后明堂乐章 皇帝行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"仰膺历数，俯顺讴歌。\n远安迩肃，俗阜时和。\n化光玉镜，讼息金科。\n方兴典礼，永戢干戈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武则天","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}